-- ===== 900602 Brinecoil Serpent, level 55: the coast's apex, in the shallows =====
-- AiImmobile: it never leaves its water (the model is built round a waterline 0.9 m above its
-- origin, the depth ACE sinks a creature in an entirely-water cell). It bites what wades in and
-- throws frost and acid at what stands on the beach; its harmful casts come up on ~0.32 of attack
-- rolls, so RevivalGuard MonsterAi treats it as a caster (holds and casts while it has mana).
-- ObjScale 2 only sizes its collision cylinder round the neck; the client draws the glb at its
-- authored size (the manifest's ignoreServerScale). Cold-proof, weak to lightning.
